  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "On a bright morning, Mother takes me into the garden and shows me how a child can help wash clothes. The washing machine is near us, but today she wants to wash a few things by hand in a tub. I carry the full basket to her and help pick up the dirty clothes before we start. She puts soap in the water and shows me how to rub a shirt with care. Soon it is clean but still wet, with drops falling from the bottom. I hang it on the line beside a sock and the jeans, leaving a little space between them. The sun shines over us, and the towel at the other end is already dry. Mother checks the rest of the clothes and asks me to bring in the dry things first. We finish our small jobs together, then sit down and enjoy the flowers.",
    "textZh": "一個明亮的早晨，媽媽帶我到花園裡，示範孩子可以如何幫忙洗衣。洗衣機就在附近，但今天她想在大桶裡用手洗幾件衣物。我把裝滿衣物的籃子提到她身邊，開始前先幫忙撿起髒衣服。她把肥皂放進水裡，示範怎麼輕輕搓洗襯衫。很快襯衫就洗乾淨了，但還是濕的，水滴從下方落下。我把它掛在曬衣繩上，放在襪子和牛仔褲旁，衣物間留一點空間。太陽照著我們，另一端的毛巾已經乾了。媽媽檢查其餘衣物，請我先把乾的衣物收進屋裡。我們一起做完這些小事，再坐下來欣賞花朵。",
